# Origins of the three remotes, without trailing slash. The values below are the development
# defaults, used when a variable is unset.
#
# Read at BUILD time by vite.config.ts through loadEnv and baked into the host. Pointing the host
# at a different URL means rebuilding it; deploying a new version of a remote at the same URL does
# not.
#
# Deliberately not VITE_-prefixed: they configure the federation plugin, and application code has
# no reason to read them.
POLL_LIST_URL=http://localhost:3001
POLL_VOTE_URL=http://localhost:3002
POLL_RESULTS_URL=http://localhost:3003
